      "title": {
        "en": "Happy visits mixed with handling concerns"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many clients describe their dogs and cats coming home happy, calm, and well-pampered after grooming or daycare playtime. However, several dissatisfied reviewers felt their pets were handled roughly when placed in kennels or left without water during lengthy drop-off appointments."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Attractive styling alongside inconsistent cuts"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Numerous pet parents love how their pets look, noting clean coats, cute haircuts, and fresh scents for senior dogs and puppies alike. In contrast, a few reviewers reported uneven ear styling, accidentally cut tails, or haircuts that did not match reference pictures provided at check-in."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Helpful attendants beside scheduling lapses"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many visitors appreciate prompt text updates and helpful service from groomers and management when arranging visits. Nevertheless, multiple complaints cite front desk disorganization, lost styling notes, and dismissive attitudes when clients addressed scheduling delays or billing disputes."
      }
    }
  ],
